section: compiler
synopsis: Support coverage reporting for view patterns
issues: #18590
mrs: !16805
description:
  Coverage reporting (:ghc-flag:`-fhpc`) now traverses into patterns and
  creates ticks for expressions contained within :extension:`ViewPatterns`.

  This provides normal coverage semantics for those embedded expressions,
  which were previously entirely ignored in coverage reporting.

  Since tick insertion is shared by coverage reporting, source notes,
  breakpoints, and profiling, this also allows those other modes to instrument
  expressions inside patterns where applicable.
